cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mcdonald in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "mcdonald: the mcDonald UAP Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  Open-source software that measures what a single-camera video of an unidentified object can
  and cannot show: background layers, clip integrity, symbology, angular scale and kinematics,
  reported as a case report that says when the footage cannot answer a question.
